OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fmost places, with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Facross Norfolk. The rain will
OL,8,Fgradually move southwards, reaching
OL,9,Fmost areas by Friday morning. Patches
OL,10,Fof fog are likely to develop in areas
OL,11,Fwhere clear spells persist.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA largely grey morning, with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain slowly clearing.
OL,15,FDrier conditions will follow, although
OL,16,Fremaining cloudy during the afternoon.
OL,17,FSome clear spells developing across
OL,18,Fthe north by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
