OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells, although
OL,7,Fshowers may develop on Sunday.
OL,8,FOvernight frosts, with a risk of
OL,9,Fpatchy freezing mist or fog.
OL,10,FTemperatures near or slightly below
OL,11,Faverage.
